OL,3,GNEWSA'Everybody was as one': Rector
OL,4,Areflects on search effort for Noah
OL,5,AWoods
OL,6,
OL,7,FThe Reverend Chris Willis said:
OL,8,F"Everybody was as one... what we saw
OL,9,Fthroughout was a real coming together
OL,10,Fof people and a willingness to work
OL,11,Ftogether which, in spite of the deep
OL,12,Fsadness, was a thread of real
OL,13,Fpositivity seeing how people cared."
